 movements. Like a woman might.
\par \tab Or a heretic. Or\'85 and the possibility confounded me but could not be ignored\'85 there were lies upon lies here, and they }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f44\fs36\insrsid5317124\charrsid6508615 were}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f44\fs36\insrsid5317124  in fact a woman. Their smell once again didn\rquote t give them away. Too foreign. Too clean. The cologne, or perfume, indistinct.
\par \tab \'93The tea will help with your throat-\'93
\par \tab \'93Untie me,\'94 I said, trying to sound commanding around a suddenly thick tongue. 
\par \tab I hadn\rquote t had fish or anything like it lately- at least not that I knew of- so this was just my body betraying me. I cursed my inability to talk to this person like the man I knew myself to be, once again. Why did this }{\rtlch\fcs1 
