\par \tab \'93Why bother\'85 bringing you here, you mean?\'94 He clarified, gingerly holding the tea out towards me again. I continued to ignore it. \'93Rather than, what? Leaving you out there to die?\'94
\par \tab \'93\'85yes.\'94 I said at length. \'93It would suit you better, would it not?\'94
\par \tab \'93Lord, what kind of question is that?\'94 his features turned displeased. Disbelieving, really. \'93What do you\'85 do you really take me for someone so cold? Perhaps at the outset, but at this point, surely-\'93
